cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Sim2Web, please cite this software using the metadata below
  and identify the exact repository commit or release used.
type: software
license: MIT
title: "Sim2Web: one-click post-processing and verifiable web publishing of geotechnical simulation results"
version: 0.2.0
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.<version-record-id>
repository-code: "https://github.com/kuonijiwa/Sim2Web"
url: "https://github.com/kuonijiwa/Sim2Web"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cheng"
    given-names: "Yongjin"
  - family-names: "Chu"
    given-names: "Weijiang"
  - name: "HydroChina Itasca"
abstract: >-
  A configuration-driven Python library and data-driven browser viewer that
  prepare geotechnical simulation results (VTK unstructured grids) for browser
  review: exterior and excavation surfaces, axis-aligned sections, field
  associations and source identifiers, with independent validation.
keywords:
  - geotechnical engineering
  - scientific visualization
  - VTK
  - PyVista
  - web visualization
